              "text": "تعطیل شدن (ta'til shodan) — \"to close (for the day or a holiday), to shut\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بازار ساعت هشت شب تعطیل شد. Bâzâr sâ'at-e hasht-e shab ta'til shod. The bazaar closed at eight in the evening."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ta'til 'closed, a holiday' + shodan. Ruz-e ta'til — a day off."
            }
          ]
        },
